  "The Autonomous Administration of North and East Syria and its Syrian Democratic Forces, the Kurdish-led alliance of Kurdish, Arab and Assyrian forces that defeated the Islamic State east of the Euphrates. American troops stand with it; Turkey counts it the same organisation as the PKK.": "The Autonomous Administration of North and East Syria and its Syrian Democratic Forces, the Kurdish-led alliance of Kurdish, Arab and Assyrian forces that defeated the Islamic State east of the Euphrates. American troops stand with it; Turkey counts it the same organisation as the PKK.",
