  "The Somali Islamist group allied to al-Qaeda. It controls much of the countryside of southern and central Somalia, where it taxes and runs courts, and its seat is Jilib in the Juba valley. The United Nations, the United States and many others list it as a terrorist organisation.": "The Somali Islamist group allied to al-Qaeda. It controls much of the countryside of southern and central Somalia, where it taxes and runs courts, and its seat is Jilib in the Juba valley. The United Nations, the United States and many others list it as a terrorist organisation.",
